@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Healthcare Portal

[*] --> RegistrationFailed

state "Registration Failed" as RegistrationFailed
state "Signed In" as SignedIn
state "Access Denied" as AccessDenied
state "Facilities Available" as FacilitiesAvailable
state "News and Expert Content" as NewsAndExpertContent
state "Health Information" as HealthInformation
state "Result Viewed" as ResultViewed
state "Payment Processed" as PaymentProcessed
state "Cash Payment Details" as CashPaymentDetails
state "Insurance-Based Payment" as InsuranceBasedPayment
state "User Feedback Collected" as UserFeedbackCollected

RegistrationFailed --> AccessDenied : registration failed / end access

SignedIn --> FacilitiesAvailable : signed in successfully / provide facilities
FacilitiesAvailable --> NewsAndExpertContent : select news or expert content / read news and expert content
NewsAndExpertContent --> HealthInformation : select health information / check symptoms or use fitness checking options
HealthInformation --> ResultViewed : view result / continue using the system or finish session

ResultViewed --> PaymentProcessed : payment required / process payment for doctor consultations
PaymentProcessed --> InsuranceBasedPayment : insurance-based payment / check payment with insurance
InsuranceBasedPayment --> CashPaymentDetails : select cash payment method / inform user about cash payment details
CashPaymentDetails --> PaymentProcessed : complete cash payment process / complete payment process

PaymentProcessed --> UserFeedbackCollected : service completed / collect user feedback
UserFeedbackCollected --> SignedIn : log out users at the end of their session / sign in again

@enduml
